  "steps": [
    "Make the sauce. Blend the onion, garlic, chipotle peppers, adobo sauce, lime juice and zest, honey, tomato paste, broth, cumin, smoked paprika, oregano, salt and pepper.*",
    "Cook the chicken. Simmer the chicken thighs in the sauce until tender and cooked through.*",
    "Shred and finish. Shred the chicken in the sauce, then stir in the cilantro and the juice of 1/2 lime.*",
    "Portion. Divide into 10 meal-prep containers (macros are per serving, without rice)."
